+**What changes when one attempt learns a whole layer.** On a success path:
+- Attempts go from "one per root value" to "one per root dependency layer, plus one".
+- Every attempt saved is a whole `composeCandidate` + `deriveComposition` + `learnCalleeValue` + `learnUnstatedViews`.
+
+A refusal or reshape decided while speculating costs the batch's attempts once; then the loop rewinds and runs as
+the base did from `origin` (section 3.0).
