+## 4. Counters (`framed/composer/counters.ts`, `SOLIDC_DEBUG_FRAMED_COUNTS=1`)
+
+Add these fields to `FramedComposerCounts` (`:24-37`) and to `zeroes()` (`:42-55`). Update the header comment
+(`:15-23`). All of them are trace-only.
+
+Also export `framedLegacyEnabled(): boolean` beside `framedCountersEnabled` (`:60`): `env()?.SOLIDC_DEBUG_FRAMED_LEGACY
+=== '1'`. `env` stays private and can be `undefined` (`:57`). Sections 2.1, 3.1 and 3.2 read the switch through it.
+
+| counter | bumped at | meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| `tracedLearned` | declaration.ts step 7 | walks with at least one authenticated close |
+| `tracedNothing` | declaration.ts step 7 | walks that ended on a stop nobody learns from |
+| `tracedPassed` | declaration.ts step 7 | walks whose run passed |
+| `tracedUnclassified` | declaration.ts step 7 | faithful singular walks ending on a readable close (the caller judges it) |
+| `suppressedCloses`, `provisionalApplied`, `provisionalRelearned` | declaration.ts, draft.ts | batch sizes |
+| `provisionalReverted` | draft.ts `settleProvisional` (2.2) | provisional values no passing run compared, put back to their placeholders |
+| `rootBatches`, `speculationRestores` | call.ts, genesis.ts, proxy/deploy.ts | root batching and its restores (section 3.0) |
+| `hopEntryAttempts`, `hopBatches` | proxy/deploy.ts `settleHop` (`:2489`); both hop loops | `settleHop` attempts; batched walks in `settleCallees` and `settleHop` (section 3.3b) |
+| `composerEvaluations` | twin `evaluate` | evaluate requests on a composer twin, hits included |
+| `memoEvaluationHits`, `memoReadHits`, `memoMisses`, `memoUnmemoizable` | run-memo.ts, declaration.ts | read-field rule |
+| `verifications`, `verifiedInputs` | verify wrapper (section 1.1) | the mock verifier's transactions and inputs |
+| `closeCopies`, `closeCopyBytes` | shared evaluate wrapper `:1303` | what copy-plus-compare still costs |
+| `callSiteEmptyWalks`, `callSiteConfirmWalks` | draft.ts `fill` | the most the recipe can save |
+| `recipeHits`, `recipeMisses`, `recipeSkips`, `recipeDeviations`, `recipeStores` | recipe.ts, draft.ts | recipe |
+| `phaseStopWalks` | `boundedWalk` (section 1.1) | walks whose final state carries an error no stepped state carries (SPEC F10) |
+
+Identities a test pins:
+- `tracedCloses = tracedLearned + tracedNothing + tracedPassed + tracedUnclassified`.
+- Composer runs are `composerEvaluations - memoEvaluationHits`.
+- Non-composer evaluations (stateful probes, the final preflight, other fast-VM callers) are
+  `evaluations - (composerEvaluations - memoEvaluationHits)`.
+- The mock verifier is `verifiedInputs`. It never appeared in `evaluations` (F1).
+
+Attribution works by machine identity, the twin, and needs no dynamic scope, so the async attempt loop cannot
+misattribute.
+
+`callSiteEmptyWalks` counts call-site fills whose learning walk applied nothing and was not answered by the memo.
+`callSiteConfirmWalks` counts confirming walks at call-site fills.
