+   - `composerMachineOf(createVirtualMachineBch2026ForProvider(provider))` is a twin with `boundedWalk`.
+   - For the programs of test 1, `final` agrees with the base's `evaluate(p)` as in test 1. The walk's reading equals
+     the reading of `base.debug(p)`, except the clean-stack failure: the walk reads `no-trace`, `debug()`
+     `not-a-close`.
+   - Test 2 passes on the twin unchanged.
+8. **Passed closes.** With `notePassed`, a walk of test 2's program with each placeholder replaced by its computed
+   value passes and notes `c1`, `c2`, `c3` once each, in order. `<c1> <c1> EQUALVERIFY <x> <y> EQUALVERIFY OP_1`
