+| item | role for the sparse observer | live provider gets |
+|---|---|---|
+| `installFastBch2026Every` `:808` | speed | libauth 2026 `every` (same checks/messages) |
+| `installCachedP2shEvaluator` `:155` | speed; exits unused by sparse | libauth `evaluate` |
