+Why type and not accessor coordinates: every family the accessors describe is a non-minting participant NFT:
+state data NFTs (`[1, 1+stateCount)` or delegate master+1), entries (`getEntryOutputBase` :6717,
+`getEntryOutputSlotOrder` :6762), events (`getEventOutputBase` :6875), return events (`getReturnEventOutputBase`
