+Scope semantics: phase 2 and the cleaned rescan evaluate `delegatecallInputIndex ?? 0` -> `'root'`; phase-1
+progressive entries evaluate group `groupIdx`'s master -> `` `group:${groupIdx}` ``. Set by a suppressing run of that
