+  fixture's; `.send()` succeeds; decoded `slots[1] == 12`, `slots[3] == 9`, `total == 4` for `ks = [1,2,3,4]`.
+- case "array collection": `int[] items;` with `items.push(a * 3 + 1); items.push(b * 5 + 2); items.push(c * 7 + 3);`
