+## 1. `debugging.ts`: log predicate and density predicate
+
+### 1a. `artifactHasDebugLogs` (new export)
+
+Location: insert before the `// debugs the template, optionally logging the execution data` comment at
+`debugging.ts:76`, after `createVirtualMachine` (`:60-75`).
+
+Current behaviour: none. The printer's sources are `getLogsForStep` at `debugging.ts:325-332`: `activeBodyDebug(step)`
+logs (from `artifact.debug.invokeDebug`), `artifact.debug.functionDebug[entryPointFuncSelector].logs`, otherwise
+`artifact.debug.logs`. The types are in `packages/utils/src/artifact.ts:923-948` (`logs` is required on
+`DebugInformation`, `FunctionDebugInformation` and `InvokeDebugInformation`; `functionDebug` and `invokeDebug` are
+optional).
